{"id":47253,"date":"2025-12-14T22:51:20","date_gmt":"2025-12-14T21:51:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-lisboa-2\/"},"modified":"2026-10-07T11:34:56","modified_gmt":"2026-10-07T10:34:56","slug":"maratona-de-lisboa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-lisboa\/","title":{"rendered":"EDP Maratona de Lisboa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">EDP Maratona de Lisboa 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>EDP Maratona de Lisboa 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a <strong>10 e 11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, consagrada como uma das provas mais emblem\u00e1ticas e deslumbrantes do panorama desportivo internacional. Integrando o prestigiado circuito <strong>European Marathon Classics<\/strong> e distinguida com o selo World Athletics Gold Label, a m\u00edtica prova de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> arranca no <strong>S\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro, \u00e0s 08:00<\/strong> na Estrada N6-7 em <strong>Carcavelos<\/strong> (Cascais), diante da NOVA SBE, percorrendo a costa atl\u00e2ntica e a margem do Rio Tejo rumo \u00e0 consagra\u00e7\u00e3o monumental na <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio<\/strong> em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Sob a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o de excel\u00eancia do <strong>Maratona Clube de Portugal<\/strong>, o grande fim de semana desportivo acolhe mais de 30.000 atletas de todo o mundo. O programa integra a corrida jovem <strong>EDP New Generation<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde e, no <strong>Domingo, 11 de Outubro, \u00e0s 09:20<\/strong>, a espetacular <strong>Hyundai Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>EDP 8K<\/strong>, com a inesquec\u00edvel travessia pedonal da <strong>Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/strong> at\u00e9 ao cora\u00e7\u00e3o da capital.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 e 11 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Estrada N6-7 (Carcavelos) \/ Ponte Vasco da Gama \/ Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio (Lisboa), Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,195 km (Maratona), 21,097 km (Meia Maratona), 8 km (EDP 8K) e Corrida Jovem<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona Clube de Portugal<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/maratonaclubedeportugal.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/Regulamento-EDP-Maratona-Lisboa-Out2026-PT.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">EDP Maratona de Lisboa<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00 \u2022 Percurso Plano \/ Marginal Costeira<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 2.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 70.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Primeiros 2.000)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (2.001 a 5.000):<\/strong> 95.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 5.000 inscritos)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (a partir de 5.000):<\/strong> 130.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">EDP New Generation<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Hyundai Meia Maratona<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20 \u2022 Partida na Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Curta \/ Prova Aberta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">EDP 8K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20 \u2022 Partida na Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e de onde parte a EDP Maratona de Lisboa 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A EDP Maratona de Lisboa realiza-se no S\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 08:00 na Estrada N6-7 em Carcavelos (junto \u00e0 NOVA School of Business &#038; Economics) e meta na Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio, em Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realizam a Hyundai Meia Maratona e a EDP 8K?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Hyundai Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e a EDP 8K realizam-se no Domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026, com partida simult\u00e2nea \u00e0s 09:20 na Ponte Vasco da Gama e chegada \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o limite de tempo regulamentar da Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O limite m\u00e1ximo de tempo para completar os 42,195 km da Maratona de Lisboa \u00e9 de 6 horas a contar do tiro de partida oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte gratuito para a partida em Carcavelos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza viagens gratuitas nos comboios da CP (Linha de Cascais) entre o Cais do Sodr\u00e9 e a esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Carcavelos (a cerca de 1 km da partida), mediante a simples apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza o levantamento do kit de atleta e dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega dos dorsais e t-shirts oficiais decorre na Sport Expo, na FIL (Feira Internacional de Lisboa &#8211; Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es), na quinta e sexta-feira, 8 e 9 de Outubro, entre as 10:00 e as 20:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"EDP Maratona de Lisboa 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e de onde parte a EDP Maratona de Lisboa 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A EDP Maratona de Lisboa realiza-se no S\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 08:00 na Estrada N6-7 em Carcavelos (junto \u00e0 NOVA School of Business & Economics) e meta na Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio, em Lisboa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realizam a Hyundai Meia Maratona e a EDP 8K?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Hyundai Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e a EDP 8K realizam-se no Domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026, com partida simult\u00e2nea \u00e0s 09:20 na Ponte Vasco da Gama e chegada \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o limite de tempo regulamentar da Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O limite m\u00e1ximo de tempo para completar os 42,195 km da Maratona de Lisboa \u00e9 de 6 horas a contar do tiro de partida oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o transporte gratuito para a partida em Carcavelos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza viagens gratuitas nos comboios da CP (Linha de Cascais) entre o Cais do Sodr\u00e9 e a esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Carcavelos (a cerca de 1 km da partida), mediante a simples apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se realiza o levantamento do kit de atleta e dos dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega dos dorsais e t-shirts oficiais decorre na Sport Expo, na FIL (Feira Internacional de Lisboa \u2013 Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es), na quinta e sexta-feira, 8 e 9 de Outubro, entre as 10:00 e as 20:00.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67397,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[31,27,478,624,41],"